Our time is now and soon you'll see!

9
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:39,197
Smile with all your heart as you go
past the problems that await you!

10
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,737
Keep your hopes alive!

11
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,257
Never look down upon yourself!

12
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,957
Just cast a magic spell!

13
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:49,257
You will get through!

14
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:51,637
Crazy, crazy rainbow!

15
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,617
Star, twinkle, twinkle!

16
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:54,777
Rainbow star!

17
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:55,777
Fast beats!

18
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:56,777
Premonitions!

19
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,757
Just like the colors from
all the rainbow beams!

20
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,257
Crazy, crazy rainbow! Star!

21
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,917
Come with me and we'll go far!

22
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,957
We're just fallen angels!

23
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,880
Shooting arrows into our hopeful dreams!

24
