Crazy, crazy rainbow star!

27
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,757
Twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!

28
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:44,677
Within the cobalt blue!

29
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:47,677
Seven colors will come to our surprise!

30
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:50,457
Crazy, crazy rainbow star!

31
00:01:50,540 --> 00:01:52,937
Twinkle, twinkle rainbow star!

32
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:55,017
Abandon all your worries!

33
