38
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:09,897
Dying, dying!

39
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:12,477
Crazy, crazy hippo star!

40
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,997
I'm a crazy hippo star!

41
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:17,557
Crazy, crazy hippo star!

42
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:20,140
I'm a crazy hippo star!

43
00:02:58,020 --> 00:02:59,920
This is one of our former chefs.

44
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:03,337
I hope you enjoy your stay at
the Maritime Restaurant Baratier?

45
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:08,117
Former home of Black Lake Sanji, the
infamous cook with a 77 million fairy bounty.

46
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:10,082
It looks just like him, I swear.

47
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:12,400
I propose a toast.

48
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,880
Raise your glasses.

49
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:18,500
Or the biggest name in all of East
Blue, with a bounty of 300 million.

50
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,060
Your friend Luffy.

51
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:21,750
Cheers!

52
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,801
Quiet down, the whole lot of you.

53
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,700
Have you fools no shame?

54
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:30,960
To me!

55
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,580
That's enough!

56
00:03:34,020 --> 00:03:34,980
It's useless.

57
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:38,006
No one listens to what
the mayor says anymore.

58
00:03:39,380 --> 00:03:40,720
What a cute pet.

59
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,297
Lucy must be having so much fun out there.

60
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:46,057
And it looks like he's made
some wonderful friends as well.

61
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:47,517
You call those thugs friends?

62
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,659
They're criminals!

63
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:56,209
Our town gave birth to a wanted criminal
that turned against the whole world.

64
00:03:56,360 --> 00:04:00,077
And what kind of pirate is crazy enough
to declare war on the darn government?

65
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,237
That's a good question.

66
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,957
Garp needs to clean up this mess.

67
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:05,337
If he hadn't left his
grandson here on this island,

68
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:06,677
none of this would have happened.

69
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:09,097
That family's been crazy
for three generations.

70
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:12,580
I wonder if Dada knows
about all this. To Luffy!

71
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:15,000
I said quiet down, didn't I?

72
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:19,990
Sniper King.

73
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,500
The king of the snipers. You're right.

74
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:23,897
There's no doubt about it.

75
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:24,810
That's Usopp.

76
00:04:24,893 --> 00:04:25,723
I told you.

77
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:27,617
You got the captain's nose, right?

78
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:28,530
Mm-hmm.

79
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:30,677
All the people in the
village didn't believe us.

80
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,054
He's worth 30 million.

81
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:35,017
Even if no one else could,
we knew you'd recognize him.

82
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:37,477
Now everyone in the world
can know how awesome he is.

83
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,737
The captain has the power
to make lies the truth.

84
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:41,467
All you gotta do is believe.

85
00:04:41,900 --> 00:04:44,037
Don't know where he got
it, but that mask is cool.

86
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,497
Let's see if we can make
our own out of clay.

87
00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:48,404
Hey, Kaya, where are you going?

88
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:52,277
I should get back to my
medical studies, that's all.

89
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,677
I have to become a good
doctor as soon as I can.

90
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:57,777
That way, if Usopp comes back here
injured after all his adventures,

91
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:59,860
I know I'll be able to fix him up.

92
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:04,140
Man, the captain sure is lucky, huh?

93
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:06,577
But I'm going to beat him up
if he ever makes Kaia sad.

94
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:07,490
Me too.

95
00:05:08,460 --> 00:05:12,477
Master, is it true that Pirate Hunter
Zoro used to study at this school too?

96
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,000
Why, yes, that is true.

97
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:16,557
But I don't want you to
see him as a role model.

98
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,522
You understand?

99
00:05:18,340 --> 00:05:19,170
Oh, why not?

100
00:05:19,253 --> 00:05:20,097
He's so awesome.

101
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:22,697
Teach us to be pirates too,
so we can be strong like him.

102
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:25,097
I didn't teach him or
anyone else to be a pirate.

103
00:05:25,180 --> 00:05:26,037
I don't believe that.

104
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,767
Are you lying to us, Master?

105
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:30,397
You never can tell quite
how they'll turn out.

106
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:33,657
I was surprised to hear about
what happened on Eni's lobby.

107
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:36,777
But I'm sure there isn't a speck of
doubt in your heart, right, Zoro?

108
00:05:36,860 --> 00:05:39,057
No matter what kind of person you become,

109
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:42,611
all I want is for you to cherish
your own way of the sword.

110
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:45,330
Hey, Genzo!

111
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,209
I brought some tangerines.

112
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,200
Again, Nojiko?

113
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,897
I keep telling you I can
buy them in the store.

114
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:53,804
No need to be uptight about it.

115
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,882
Just take them.

116
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:57,157
Besides, you're like a
father to me and Nami.

117
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,617
I wouldn't dream of charging you.

118
00:05:58,700 --> 00:05:59,660
If you insist.

119
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:01,338
What are you up to?

120
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,030
Hmm?

121
00:06:03,113 --> 00:06:03,943
Oh, uh...

122
00:06:04,026 --> 00:06:05,197
I've been trying to file a complaint to

123
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:07,297
Navy headquarters with
the transponder snail,

124
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:08,537
but they won't pick up the line.

125
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:09,450
A complaint?

126
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:11,560
To the Navy? That's right.

127
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,357
Do they really think
they can distribute such

128
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,617
an explicit wanted poster
all over the world?

129
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:19,997
At this rate, she'll have more marriage
suitors than bounty hunters after her.

130
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:24,609
Well, you seem to like the picture at
least, seeing as you blew it up so big.

131
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:27,526
I wouldn't let it get to you.

132
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:30,017
After all, at least you know
they kept their promise.

133
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:35,100
I know Lamy's going away with you, but if
any of you ever do anything to hurt her,

134
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:36,640
I will kill you.

135
00:06:37,300 --> 00:06:39,580
That smile is all the proof we need.

136
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:43,960
Well, I suppose so, but I'd rather
she stop being a pirate. Oh, yeah?

137
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,877
You want to take that smile away?

138
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:46,790
Of course not!

139
00:06:46,873 --> 00:06:48,584
That's not what I meant at all!

140
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:04,900
Dr. Kureha.

141
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:07,917
Dalton, what did you call
me down here for, huh?

142
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,882
I'm a very busy woman, you know.

143
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:14,077
Well, I'm sorry to trouble you, but when
you see these, I think you'll understand.

144
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,417
Not gonna ask me the
secret to my eternal youth?

145
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:18,088
Oh, and by the way, Dalton,

146
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,957
since you're the king and all, don't
you think you should live in the castle?

147
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,697
I'll rent a room out to you.

148
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:25,677
I've stayed in this village for so
long that I think I prefer it here.

149
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:28,500
I also prefer to have
chestnuts with my rice.

150
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:32,937
Well, if it isn't the Straw Hat
kid and all his little friends.

151
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:36,497
Their new wanted poster
showed up after that incident.

152
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:37,410
In Enies Lobby.

153
00:07:37,493 --> 00:07:42,360
Chopper, I'm sure the amount
is some sort of mistake.

154
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:46,637
Seeing his face again is worth
all the berries in the world.

155
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,977
That's good as long as he's happy.

156
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:51,337
That's all I need.

157
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:56,777
Unbelievable.

158
00:07:56,860 --> 00:08:02,260
Nico Robin, what in the world is Miss
All Sunday doing on Luffy's crew?

159
00:08:02,860 --> 00:08:06,817
I knew there was something mysterious about
that woman, but this is quite the shock.

160
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:09,257
If this news reaches Princess Vivi,

161
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:12,222
I can only imagine how
disheartened she would be?

162
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,421
Oh, don't worry.

163
00:08:13,580 --> 00:08:14,857
I already heard about that.

164
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:16,017
It's no big deal, though.

165
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,276
It's not a big deal.

166
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:20,087
I thought you of all
people would be shocked.

167
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:22,917
Even when you're as close
to Luke Lee as I was,

168
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,588
you can never quite
tell what he's thinking.

169
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:30,645
Whether I understand his reasoning or not,
I still believe in everything he does.

170
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:34,817
Because I know that he's going to
be king of the pirates one day.

171
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:37,488
The best we can do is
respect his decisions.

172
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:38,730
How forgiving.

173
00:08:38,813 --> 00:08:42,480
You've turned into such a fine
young lady, Princess Vivi.

174
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:45,040
Hey, it's nothing to cry about.

175
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:49,917
Our forces have triumphed in Centaurion.

176
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,830
We did it.

177
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:54,280
Another kingdom has fallen.

178
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:55,597
We're on a roll, huh?

179
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,697
We had a big victory
in the North Blue, too.

180
00:08:57,780 --> 00:08:58,610
This is war.

181
00:08:58,700 --> 00:09:00,637
Even in victory, we must be humble.

182
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,550
Of course, sir.

183
00:09:01,633 --> 00:09:02,463
I'm sorry.

184
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,997
What is this? Huh?

185
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,960
The posters?

186
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,657
They're for the Straw Hat Pirates.

187
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:13,497
They're the ones who took
out Crocodile and Alabasta.

188
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:16,617
They recently caused a big
incident at Eni's Lobby, too.

189
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:19,700
The government can't afford
to ignore them anymore.

190
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:25,240
After their recent actions, their total
bounty jumped to 666 million and 50 berries.

191
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:28,717
Also, their captain is Vice
Admiral Garp's grandson.

192
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,630
Huh?

193
00:09:29,713 --> 00:09:30,543
Is something wrong?

194
00:09:30,626 --> 00:09:32,142
I'm going to get some fresh air.

195
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:38,297
Follow your own beliefs to the end, Luffy.

196
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:41,137
With a will such as
yours and a little luck!

197
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:44,396
The masses may learn to
question this world after all?

198
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,957
Ride the winds of change, my son!

199
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:53,000
That day you and I meet will
come soon enough, I'm sure.

200
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:04,317
Three days before the Straw Hat
Pirates new bounties shocked the world!

201
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:08,317
Another history changing of it was
about to occur not far from Water 7!

202
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:10,477
This is Bonero Island,

203
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:12,837
a small settlement that
will soon be turned

204
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:16,260
upside down in a duel
between fire and shadow.

205
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,510
Whoa!

206
00:10:19,593 --> 00:10:20,423
What do you know?

207
00:10:20,506 --> 00:10:22,100
It's Commander Ace!

208
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:24,877
You have no right to call me that anymore.

209
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:28,240
Use that title with respect,
but don't use it at all.

210
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,160
I won't have you mock me.

211
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:34,000
Ooh, so this is the famous Fire Fist Ace.

212
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:37,440
Yep, that's me. You guessed it.

213
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:38,837
So this is your crew.

214
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:41,685
It looks like you've
become a captain now, huh?

215
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,160
Captain Marshall D.

216
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:45,680
Teach of the Blackbeard Pirates.

217
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,920
Yeah, come on a slight enough.

218
00:10:50,100 --> 00:10:51,517
It's good to see you again.

219
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,835
What brings you here?

220
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,256
You weren't looking for me, were you?

221
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:59,402
Let's stop beating around
the bush now, shall we?

222
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:03,136
Even if you play dumb, I
know you're a crafty bastard.

223
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:06,957
There's only one reason for me to
be here, and you know what it is.

224
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,460
Fine, have it your way.

225
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:11,557
But there's one question
I'd like to ask first.

226
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:15,287
Instead of fighting, why don't
you become a member of my crew?

227
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:19,097
I have the perfect plan
to rise to the top.

228
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:22,280
If you stick with me, I
swear we can rule the world.

229
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:24,877
Whitebeard's days are
numbered and you know it.

230
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:27,680
I'm gonna be king of the pirates. First,

231
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:30,097
I'm headed off to Water
7 to kill Straw Hat

232
00:11:30,180 --> 00:11:33,004
Luffy as a special gift
to the world government.

233
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:35,728
Wouldn't hurt to have
you along for the fun.

234
00:11:36,900 --> 00:11:37,730
Luffy, huh?

235
00:11:37,813 --> 00:11:39,112
You're out of your mind.

236
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:40,820
Oh, you know him?

237
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,357
Of course I know him, you sack of crap.

238
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:47,264
I'm not going to let you
kill my little brother.

239
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:51,077
And I'm not joining your crew.

240
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:54,336
You can take your little
offer and shove it up your...

241
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,540
Well, you get it.

242
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:02,717
Looks like you need to teach
your crew some manners, Captain.

243
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,630
Fire gun!

244
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,550
Flyer Filler!

245
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:21,960
Oh, Garbertus!

246
00:12:22,180 --> 00:12:24,237
Both of you stay out of this fight!

247
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,037
Until you get stronger, this
guy is out of your league!

248
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:27,950
Do you hear me?

249
00:12:28,033 --> 00:12:28,863
Oh, sorry!

250
00:12:28,946 --> 00:12:29,776
Fly or bear!

251
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,220
Are you okay?

252
00:12:38,300 --> 00:12:39,130
Captain!

253
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:46,650
Here.

254
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,540
Get off of me, I'm fine.

255
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,980
Just step back.

256
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:05,840
All righty.

257
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,180
I get it.

258
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,381
You want to finish me, don't you?

259
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:13,380
The murder of a fellow Gourmet
is a serious crime, after all.

260
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:17,857
And yes, I killed 4th Division
Commander Thatcher with my own hands,

261
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:19,940
but there wasn't any other choice.

262
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:23,517
It wasn't personal, but he had the
Devil Fruit I'd been searching for.

263
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:28,037
You know the rules on Whitebeard's ship,
whoever finds one of those gets to eat it.

264
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:32,557
I memorized the shapes and colors of all
the devil's fruits that they discovered,

265
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:34,758
so I knew that was the one I needed.

266
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:40,337
Whether I liked it or not, I spent decades
biding my time on Whitebeard's ship,

267
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:44,538
because that was the best shot I had
at finding that one single fruit.

268
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:47,985
But just when I thought
there was no hope left,

269
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:51,360
there it was, right in
the hand of my friend.

270
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:58,220
Then you murdered him in cold blood
and stole it, without a second thought.

271
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:01,480
Bad luck for him.

272
00:14:01,940 --> 00:14:03,480
There's no other way.

273
00:14:03,780 --> 00:14:06,140
This ability has chosen me.

274
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:12,700
And its powers may be the
strongest man in the world.

275
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,270
Watch.

276
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:17,831
Even among the Logia fruits,
there's nothing quite like it.

277
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:24,640
Ace, your body is made of fire, right?

278
00:14:31,860 --> 00:14:34,460
My body is darkness.

279
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,437
Look, it's that weird
black smoke from before!

280
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,117
I thought those pirates were leaving.

281
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,457
What are we gonna do now?

282
00:14:41,540 --> 00:14:43,277
I don't know what they
want, but it can't be good.

283
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,777
They're gonna wreck the
entire town at this rate!

284
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:47,137
Well, we sure can't stop them.

285
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:48,820
It's best just to run away!

286
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:57,490
Darkness...

287
00:14:57,840 --> 00:15:00,260
You'll see soon enough, Commander Ace.

288
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,989
I think you'll want to
reconsider my offer.

289
00:15:03,260 --> 00:15:05,260
In the history of all Devilfruits,

290
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:08,357
this is said to be the most
dangerous power of them all!

291
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,660
The Logia-type Dark Darkfruit!

292
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:14,100
In other words, I've
become a Darkness man!

293
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:16,479
I'll give you a taste of its power!

294
00:15:16,860 --> 00:15:22,920
I wouldn't blink if I were
you stop yapping and do it

295
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:28,457
Now ain't the time for
a nap captain's on a

296
00:15:28,540 --> 00:15:30,537
rampage if we don't hide
till it out of here.

297
00:15:30,620 --> 00:15:31,450
He'll kill us

298
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:58,677
Look, it's crawling on the ground.

299
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:00,917
It keeps pouring out of him more and more.

300
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,120
This is too creepy!

301
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:04,917
It's pitch black, like a bottomless pit.

302
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,800
What if it sucks us up?

303
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,797
Everyone make a run for it!

304
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:09,821
Get out of here!

305
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:13,340
Run to the forest! Run to the coast!

306
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,755
Just get away, quick!

307
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,377
Darkness is gravity.

308
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:24,977
It swallows everything around it.

309
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:27,277
Even light itself can't escape.

310
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:29,597
Its power is infinite.

311
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:32,737
That's nice.

312
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:34,037
But it's nowhere near me.

313
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:36,217
You sure you got the hang of this?

314
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:37,317
Calm down.

315
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:39,277
I'm not aiming at you yet.

316
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:42,400
You'll be glad when you
see what I do to this town?

317
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:47,320
Let's go!

318
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:09,937
Hotel, it's being
swallowed into the earth!

319
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:11,500
Why is he doing this?

320
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:12,820
What's going on?

321
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:23,040
Within these shadows lies a limitless
vow to compress anything and everything.

322
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:25,660
To crush whatever they touch.

323
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:41,480
This is a nightmare!

324
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:42,700
My home!

325
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,965
But that's just the beginning.

326
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:56,947
Now I'll show you what
happened to that town.

327
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:59,580
Or whatever's left of it, I should say.

328
00:18:00,820 --> 00:18:01,650
Liberation!

329
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,360
It's all gone.

330
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:18,653
Nothing left but power.

331
00:18:22,180 --> 00:18:24,000
So do you get it now, Ace?

332
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:27,062
This was what I was willing
to tell a friend for.

333
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:30,630
Firefly.

334
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:31,810
Fiery dog.

335
00:18:40,460 --> 00:18:43,360
The darkness part I get,
but this not so much.

336
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:46,140
I wonder what's going on here.

337
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:49,317
If you're a Loki attack, that
shouldn't hurt you, or rather,

338
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,929
it shouldn't even hit you.

339
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,480
I already told you,

340
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:07,277
my darkness swallows everything
around it, whether it's punches,

341
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:09,457
blades, bullets, lightning, or fire.

342
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:12,737
Unlike you, I can't just turn into
an element and dodge an attack.

343
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:17,800
And the pain I absorb when I get hit is
much greater than what a normal human feels.

344
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:23,137
But the trade-off for that
inconvenience is more than worth it,

345
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:26,077
because there happens to be
one other thing I can absorb.

346
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,060
Black Vortex!

347
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:30,930
First,

348
00:19:31,013 --> 00:19:35,407
I use the gravity of darkness to pull a
Devil Fruit power holder into my grasp.

349
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:40,760
Too strong!

350
00:19:44,940 --> 00:19:47,120
And then when I touch them

351
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:57,760
You're smart if you figured
out the secret yet, huh?

352
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,440
It can't be

353
00:20:26,540 --> 00:20:31,305
It's been so long since you've been hit,
I bet you forgot how much it hurts, Ace.

354
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:36,240
But you understand now, you
understood the second I grabbed you.

355
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:43,140
Not only can my darkness pull you in, it
can also absorb your Devil Fruit power!

356
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:47,700
In other words, as long as
they're in contact with me,

357
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:51,657
someone with Devil Fruit powers is
no different than a normal human.

358
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:54,157
Logia, Snow, Parameathia...

359
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,677
All those with Devil Fruit powers who have

360
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:59,337
become dependent on them
are in for a surprise.

361
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:02,891
One little touch will remind
them how weak they really are.

362
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:07,497
Then all I have to do is
avoid you if you think you

363
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:10,940
can escape gravity that
easily I'd like to see you try

364
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:41,560
That bastard almost broke my neck.

365
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:46,774
His ability is going to be a
bigger pain than I thought.

366
00:21:48,300 --> 00:21:49,130
Crossfire!

367
00:22:00,740 --> 00:22:02,440
Banana Rock is falling.

368
00:22:02,780 --> 00:22:04,133
Nothing's safe anymore.

369
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:07,475
No one should have this kind of power.

370
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,993
Who are these monsters?

371
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,480
Forget about the town.

372
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:14,920
They'll destroy the entire island.

373
00:22:15,180 --> 00:22:16,220
We're done for.

374
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:26,917
This is quite a surprise.

375
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:29,817
Most Devil Fruit power
holders with one such as his!

376
00:22:29,900 --> 00:22:33,657
Would be rendered ineffective as soon as
their trump card was taken away from them.

377
00:22:33,740 --> 00:22:35,057
Not so with Ace.

378
00:22:35,140 --> 00:22:38,857
His powers are not a crutch
but an aid to his own talents.

379
00:22:38,940 --> 00:22:42,357
We should expect no less from
one of Whitebeard's commanders.

380
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:44,217
We're at the crossroads of fate.

381
00:22:44,300 --> 00:22:47,460
It's no coincidence that
these men have been brought

382
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:04,790
together.

383
00:23:04,873 --> 00:23:06,417
Everything falls before darkness.

384
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:09,877
Even you can only struggle for so long.

385
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:13,677
Still finishing you off here
would be a waste of your talent.

386
00:23:13,760 --> 00:23:15,180
Don't

387
00:23:24,500 --> 00:23:29,600
If I surrender to you, then I could
never call myself a man again.

388
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:33,969
I won't submit and I won't live
with regrets no matter what.

389
00:23:34,500 --> 00:23:35,676
You got that stupid?

390
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:39,820
Once you die, your morals are useless.

391
00:23:40,500 --> 00:23:43,400
I'm sorry you can't understand that, Ace.

392
00:23:45,560 --> 00:23:47,280
Cardass, take care!

393
00:23:48,280 --> 00:23:50,320
Green Flame Commandment!

394
00:23:58,300 --> 00:24:00,040
Flame Emperor!

395
00:24:07,980 --> 00:24:10,260
The sun against darkness, huh?

396
00:24:10,560 --> 00:24:12,220
Only one can win!

397
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:14,800
I'll make Whitebeard the king.

398
00:24:15,180 --> 00:24:16,780
Or die trying.

399
00:24:17,300 --> 00:24:18,130
There!

400
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:40,637
Although no one realized it at the time,

401
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:43,477
The duel at Benero Island
that day was not merely

402
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:45,957
a struggle between
Whitebeard and Blackbeard.

403
00:24:46,040 --> 00:24:47,099
It was a catalyst.

404
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:51,735
This was the beginning of a chain of
events that could change the world.
